      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-20T18:21:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] This `if` block is empty. If `test_get_error_count()` is non-zero, it means an assertion failed (like `system_is_locked()` returning 0 when 1 was expected). In this case, the test should probably be marked as failed explicitly, otherwise it might proceed to the next step if the reboot didn\u0027t happen.",
      "revId": "8189659ee91bf7cfe9425b72d5f42fd10f0021c0",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5b919013_e7c98c0d",
